E2B Code Interpreter is a JavaScript/TypeScript SDK that provides secure, stateful code execution in cloud sandboxes.
It enables AI agents and applications to run dynamic code safely in isolated environments, supporting multiple programming languages with real-time streaming and comprehensive result handling.
